        "id": 207571,
        "name": "QuirkyDM",
        "username": "QuirkyDM",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/quirkydm/{size}/2033_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-11-02T02:26:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Easy mint. It might have been Hallowe'en, but Christmas came early. The drums came out very soon, but Santa Guise proved the solution for that, feeding Gloomweaver presents every turn and stuffing his stocking with everyone else's presents. Then the Grimoire came out, but by that time Stealth Bot was around to mostly distract Gloomweaver while Fixer, Santa Guise and Absolute Zero sat around discarding cards and rewriting the book to tell the tale of the Night Before Christmas. Abosolute Zero brought some festive weather with Sub-Zero atmosphere so that whenever the cultists showed up, Unity broke out her not-so-small collection of toys and played with them all in the snow until they decided to go home and sing carols with their families.</p><p>Absolute Zero started a huge bonfire to finish off the night. Last anyone saw of Gloomweaver, him and Guise were leaning against one another with a trail of vodka bottles scattered behind them and looking to find some reindeer to ride.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:37:16.317Z",
