        "id": 207574,
        "name": "FrivYeti",
        "username": "FrivYeti",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-11-03T23:04:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This may have been one of my dumbest Mints ever.</p><p>Right on Turn 1, Mr. Fixer played Driving Mantis. Then the Ethereal Bonds came out, and Mr. Fixer had the most health, so every Environment Turn they redirected damage to Gloomweaver, who was promptly locked down. Mr. Fixer and Guise blew up every cultist and zombie that came out while Unity's rapidly expanding robot swarms energy bolted Gloom and Absolute Zero just set everyone on frost.&nbsp;</p><p>Gloomweaver never got to do damage again. He had his Drum and Grimoire out by the end, but since they both caused him to do damage, I ignored them completely.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:37:16.524Z",
