      {
        "id": 207575,
        "name": "mightyschoop",
        "username": "mightyschoop",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ac8455/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-11-06T16:38:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint. Unity and Zero did the hard work. I eventually had apertures, 2 impales and a Cold Snap out for Zero, allowing 8 damage each turn before he even played a card.<br>\nUnity got out several bots, with a pair of zaps from platform bots adding another 6 to gloomy each round.<br>\nGuide gave out presents. Also now realize I’m that Guy doesn’t copy Impale.<br>\nFixer mostly beat up pins and cultists, since I couldn’t find Grease Monkey Fist until the last round. of course, finding it made it the last round because I smacked Zero with a crowbar and made him Blast Gloomy with 9 cold damage for the kill.</p>",
        "post_number": 25,
